|----------|-------|-----------|
| 🔴 Critical | 1 | String allocations in ToString (7 Replace/Contains calls per invocation) |
| 🟡 Moderate | 4 | Oversized struct, missing Ordinal, repeated CurrentCulture, duplicate cascade |
| ℹ️ Info | 1 | Non-readonly struct causes defensive copies |

